{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07845","headline":"途中遇晴 · 孟浩然","name":"途中遇晴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已失巴陵雨，犹逢蜀坂泥。\n天开斜景遍，山出晚云低。\n余湿犹沾草，残流尚入溪。\n今宵有明月，乡思远凄凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗品彚（附唐诗拾遗）》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩品彚_(四庫全書本)）"}